depositFunds
├── caller is not the fixed pool
│   └── it must reject without accepting public ETH positions
├── intake is disabled or receipt is zero
│   └── it must reject atomically
└── intake is enabled
    ├── it must conserve gross ETH across the three assigned buckets
    ├── odd wei and zero/full investment weights must be deterministic
    ├── changing future weights must not reassign old pending cash
    └── forced ETH must remain unassigned without explicit Safe classification
